    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "tiny pockets of relief? i dont think that's enough anymore. it's like trying to empty the ocean with a teaspoon. the \"control\" you're talking about feels non existent. if the script is truly broken, then maybe the only way to stop the performance is to just... stop. to just have everything go quiet. it feels like that's the only way to actually get some peace from all this noise.",
